<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Endurance Blocks</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Target 60g carbs/hr. Practice this prescription.

MAIN SET:
• 30min @ 56-75% FTP, RPE 3-4
• 10min @ 56-75% FTP, RPE 3-4
• 30min @ 56-75% FTP, RPE 3-4
• 10min @ 56-75% FTP, RPE 3-4
• 30min @ 56-75% FTP, RPE 3-4
• Position: Alternating - Alternate every 30 min: 30 min drops (aero) → 30 min hoods (power)
• Cadence: self-selected - Comfortable endurance cadence

COOL-DOWN:
• 10min easy spin Z1-Z2 (RPE 3-4)</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <SteadyState Duration="1800" Power="0.75"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.70"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="1800" Power="0.75"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.70"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="1800" Power="0.75"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="600" PowerLow="0.65" PowerHigh="0.50"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>